# Prettier owns TypeScript in this repo and nothing else.
#
# Everything is ignored, then .ts/.tsx are re-included. Markdown is authored by
# hand (STYLE.md, CLAUDE.md, the .claude rules) and must not be prose-rewrapped;
# JSON/YAML/mjs/bin were never prettier-formatted here either — until the global
# `parser: "typescript"` was removed they could not even be parsed, so a check
# over them reported a SyntaxError rather than a diff.
#
# Widening prettier's scope is a deliberate, separate decision: it would rewrite
# CI workflows and every package.json, so it does not ride along with a
# printWidth change.
*
!*/
!*.ts
!*.tsx
